## Request

Extend the existing canonical project projection with the minimum current-state fields needed for
an operator executive review. Add deterministic render and check behavior for a tracked,
easy-to-find `work/100k.md` projection containing a short executive section and a complete bounded
strategic ledger. Surface authoritative identity/lifecycle, planning order and readiness, outcomes,
reconciliation, recursive closure, loop findings, focus-area coverage, recent material changes,
decisions or attention needed, and safe next-cycle recommendations from existing state.

Do not add a 100k-specific database, lifecycle, queue, item identity, or hidden priority model.
Retain existing status, overview, queue, planning-order, and loop commands as drill-down and machine
APIs; document 100k as the normal operator review. Treat manual edits to the generated view as
stale projection content and explain where authoritative changes belong.

Stop after focused implementation proof, repository validation, strict Doctor, configured
development deployment/checks, exact Work2 release-cohort registration, and a durable Hybrid
checkpoint. Do not push, release, publish, promote production, mutate DisplayTest, or synchronize
installed production clients.

